s born without magic  then presumably she could have let him  stay with her safely  but if she also absorbs life force then  asta would have still been in danger if  lychita had kept him with her  and so if that's true it makes sense why  she felt that she had to give him  up to the orphanage the other  interesting thing that i want to talk  about is the five  leaf grimoire it seems that because  zagred  never ended up taking possession of this  grimoire after creating it  it remained empty after the elf massacre  at some point lichita found it and then  used it to seal away liba  in order to protect him and presumably  this happened before sakran located the  grimoire again  after awakening in her anti-bird form  everything  is finally coming together and now that  we've talked about this  awesome and heartbreaking origin story  for both liba  and lychita we need to talk about what  this means for the present  liba doesn't seem to realize that asta  is leachita's son  asta clearly reminds him of her but  since she gave osta  up before he ever met her liba doesn't  realize that asta is essentially his  adoptive  brother as a result liba is prepared to  use  osta and even take over his body in  order to get his revenge on lucifer but  once liba inevitably learns that asta is  lichita's biological son i think that  his approach  is definitely going to change instead of  trying to use asta as a tool  he is going to work together with asta  and both of them are going to fight to  honor the memory  of their mother i honestly can't wait to  see that happen  long lost brothers coming together to  defeat dante and lucifer  and save the world such freaking hype  man i can't believe how many parallels  we have between the lives of  asta and liba both were born as outcasts  without magic  both of them defied the odds and became  strong  both were the sons of the same woman and  now they're both  linked and fighting together after all  these years  i'm probably gonna have to make a whole  video talking about this relationship  between austin liba because it's so  fascinating i'm sure there's going to be  a lot of tension between them at first  and i'm sure there's going to be drama  but at the end of the day these reveals  will just bring asta and liba closer  together  and make them a stronger team in the  long run let me know what you guys think  this might have been my favorite chapter  in all of  black clover do you guys agree let me  know  down below also how do you feel about  the origin stories of lychita and liba  and did you like the twist that asta and  his devil are actually  adoptive brothers even though they don't  seem to know it yet  finally it turns out that we still don't  know anything about asta's father  so who do you think he was was he just a  random guy who was maybe born without  magic  or was he someone more special and more  importantly  is he still alive definitely include  your feedback down in the comments below  don't forget to follow us on twitch to  join our live discussions on the latest  leaks and reveals  twitch.tv slash anime opera or just  click the top  link in the description if you enjoyed  this video and you want to see more  black clover content right here on the  channel please leave a like to let me  know it really does help  and if you're new to anime pro or you  just haven't subscribed  make this the video that you subscribe  and hit that notification bell to turn  on  all notifications remember that you have  to go through the trouble of clicking  that bell and selecting the option that  says all  if you don't do it youtube is still  gonna bury a lot of our videos  even if you are subscribed it's just how  it works  you can also hit me up on twitter and  instagram  at anime uproar a big thank you to all  of our  anime uproar patrons who make videos  like this one possible  special thank you to alpha sigma and  liam thompson  disciples of lord tuigo himself and i  can't forget our the one  tie